
==============================================================================
STAGE 1  Spherical semi-analytic screen of K = exp[f_nl(qbar) I + f_T(qbar) That]
==============================================================================
In spherical symmetry the field equation integrates exactly, so the
screen is closed-form: g(r) = G M(<r) / (k_r(r) r^2) with
k_r = exp(f_nl - 2 f_T/sqrt6).  No solver is needed until Stage 2.
